'''Earth''' is the 1st stage in [[Cats of the Cosmos]]. [[Shibalien Elite]] is introduced in Chapter 1, Chapter 2 is [[UltraBaaBaa]]'s first Cats of the Cosmos appearance, and [[Mesocosmocyclone]] debuts in Chapter 3.

