==Battleground==
===<u>Chapter 1</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Shibalien Elite|Dagshund}}
*1 [[Shibalien Elite]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*4 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 6.67~8.67 seconds<sup>200f~260f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|UltraBaaBaa|Dagshund}}
*1 [[UltraBaaBaa]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*4 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 6.67~8.67 seconds<sup>200f~260f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Mesocosmocyclone|Kid Tappa}}
*1 [[Mesocosmocyclone]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Kid Tappa]] spawns after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
No particular strategy is needed. Just use the lineup you used for the [[Moon (Into the Future)|Moon]] in [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1, but without [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating Cats]]. Note that it is recommended to clear all of Into the Future before starting Cats of the Cosmos, so you can get [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and start unlocking [[Talents]].

==='''Chapter 2'''===
A similar strategy you used for Chapter 1 will work, just make sure to bring a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] to deal with UltraBaaBaa. Any Barrier Breaker will do here, with the most easily accessible option being [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]], but more reliable ones like [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fencer Cat]] or the [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast Cannon]] will be needed for later encounters.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
All you need is a meatshield that can be warped and Awakened Bahamut Cat. [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] can help if you can't afford Awakened Bahamut Cat in time, and so will Starting Money UP [[Cat Combo]]s.

During the battle, don't upgrade the [[Worker Cat]]. Spawn a non-[[:Category:Cats with Warp Immunity|Immune to Warp]] meatshield after the boss shockwave to stop Kid Tappa. As soon as Mesocosmocyclone hits your base, spawn Awakened Bahamut Cat. If you brought Seafarer Cat, now is the time to summon him. Awakened Bahamut Cat will kill Mesocosmocyclone easily after that.

