==Trivia==
*The design of Earth's [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] is the same as [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Nagasaki Prefecture]]'s.
*Chapter 2 is the first stage of [[Cats of the Cosmos]] to include [[UltraBaaBaa]], but her actual debut was in [[Singularityville]], which was released when there was only one CotC chapter. This is why she appears so much earlier into [[Legend Stages]] than [[Kid Tappa]] and [[Ribbo]].
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]] the stage uses a unique crystal-like design that isn't used anywhere in the mobile version.

